      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do remember this being added because of a measurable reason, so we should have a good reason to remove this.\n\nI believe the issue with FreeType is that internally it does a linear search of the cmap tables for each lookup (doesn\u0027t cache itself), which DirectWrite and CoreText internally already have a cache like this anyway. I\u0027m not sure about Fontations.",
